# Copy to .env (git-ignored) in the repository root. A variable set in the environment overrides .env.

# Lyceum Study static site (deploy-site, rollback-site): the SSH destination that can write the site directory (no
# default; the deploys run as root), the directory whose `current` symlink Caddy serves, and the URL checked after a
# deploy (default https://study.lyceum.quest for production, https://study.internal.blu.cx for staging).
# ARISTOS_DEPLOY_HOST=root@lyceum-prod
# ARISTOS_DEPLOY_DIR=/var/www/aristos
# ARISTOS_SITE_URL=https://study.lyceum.quest

# Per-run switches, read only from the environment, never from .env, so a production deploy is always a deliberate
# command:
#   ARISTOS_DEPLOY_PRODUCTION=1  required by deploy-site and rollback-site for production
#   ARISTOS_PRELOAD_ARCHIVE=<path>  fetch-preload uses this local archive (still checked against the pin)
